#
# K375 guest sshd policy for the fake-peer tracer. The host key is generated on the host at
# fixture-build time, so the guest does not need ssh-keygen or a writable /etc. Logging stays on
# stderr (`-e`), which the service captures on the serial console.

Port 22
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0
PidFile /tmp/sshd.pid
HostKey /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key
PermitRootLogin yes
AllowUsers root raven
PasswordAuthentication yes
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
AuthorizedKeysFile none
StrictModes no
PrintMotd no
UseDNS no
LogLevel DEBUG1
